<label>Partnership capital method<select class="input" name="capital_method"><option value="">Choose if partnership</option><?php foreach(['fixed','fluctuating'] as $method): ?><option <?= ($selectedPolicy['capital_method']??'')===$method?'selected':'' ?> value="<?= $method ?>"><?= ucfirst($method) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></label>
<p class="muted">For partnerships, select every participating partner and confirm ratios as fractions summing to 1. Fixed capital transfers profit and drawings to current accounts. Fluctuating capital uses the registered capital accounts. A current account must be distinct from all partners' capital and drawings accounts.</p>
